`namesakeCount` — computed in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AssignOwnerNamesakeCount.java` (lines 16-27): counts pre-existing owners with the same first+last name (case-insensitive) via `OwnerRepository.findAll()`; the new owner isn't yet persisted, so it's excluded.

